cqrlib
------------------------------------------
CQRlib is an ANSI C implementation of a utility library for quaternion
arithmetic and quaternion rotation math.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libCQRlib-devel-1.1.4-1bl2
  libCQRlib2-1.1.4-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/yayahjb/cqrlib

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/yayahjb/cqrlib/archive/refs/tags/CQRlib-1.1.4.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack cqrlib-1.1.4-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./cqrlib-1.1.4-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/cqrlib-1.1.4-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/cqrlib-1.1.4-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libCQRlib2-1.1.4-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libCQRlib-devel-1.1.4-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(cqrlib)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/cqrlib.README
  /usr/share/doc/cqrlib/CMakeLists.txt
  /usr/share/doc/cqrlib/README
  /usr/share/doc/cqrlib/README_CQRlib.txt
  /usr/share/doc/cqrlib/html/README_CQRlib.html
  /usr/share/doc/cqrlib/html/index.html
  /usr/share/doc/cqrlib/lgpl.txt

(libCQRlib2)
  /usr/bin/cygCQRlib-2.dll

(libCQRlib-devel)
  /usr/include/cqrlib.h
  /usr/lib/libCQRlib.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/cqrlib.pc

